{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Also</b> this prophet—we do not know his generation or his family, and he prophesied concerning the fall of the Chaldeans. And this prophet began to speak in the voice of the pious of Israel, who were crying out to HaShem because of the violence of Nebuchadnezzar."], :book :habakkuk, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["<b>Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk</b>- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"] ["Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:47.799128479Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}